+- Structured error envelopes may diverge across CLI, event, and API-like surfaces. [medium]: Centralize Pydantic models and test every reachable surface against the same serialized fields.
+- Pre-existing dirty files or ahead-of-origin state may complicate final commit/push. [medium]: Inspect git status before edits, stage only scoped paths, and escalate before touching unrelated uv.lock or pull helper scripts.
